{"3381950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Radiant Rush", "steam_appid": 3381950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/f33e561bded5e35298ef4da30bc6b835.poster.avif?t=1784314045\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/f33e561bded5e35298ef4da30bc6b835.webm?t=1784314045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/f33e561bded5e35298ef4da30bc6b835.mp4?t=1784314045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant threat... a cosmic highway... a synesthetic journey through the rhythm of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the Flow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not possess brakes. You only control the steering, leaving your trajectory entirely at the mercy of your speed. Built for precision and anticipation, every turn requires absolute focus to maintain your momentum through the cosmic void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/905fb3fcf6347875bf7b2de2de4c14a8.poster.avif?t=1784314045\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/905fb3fcf6347875bf7b2de2de4c14a8.webm?t=1784314045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/extras/905fb3fcf6347875bf7b2de2de4c14a8.mp4?t=1784314045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Symbiosis of Sound and Sight</h2><p 